   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.64,
   "block": "books.dlg21",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Sure, kids like knowing what their parents believe. You can also ask her what she thinks, which tends to start a great conversation.",
